<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>批量导入客户档案</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: #f5f6f8; margin: 0; color: #1f2937; }
      .bar { background: #1f2937; color: #fff; padding: 0 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; height: 54px; }
      .brand { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
      .nav { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex: 1; }
      .nav-link { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
      .nav-link.on { color: #fff; background: #2563eb; }
      .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 20px; }
      .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 30px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06); margin-bottom: 16px; }
      h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 17px; }
      .alert { padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .alert-err { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; color: #b91c1c; }
      .alert-ok  { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; color: #15803d; }
      .steps { counter-reset: step; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
      .steps li { counter-increment: step; position: relative; padding: 0 0 18px 34px; font-size: 14px; color: #374151; }
      .steps li::before {
        content: counter(step); position: absolute; left: 0; top: -2px;
        width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2563eb; color: #fff;
        font-size: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      }
      .steps li:not(:last-child)::after {
        content: ""; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 22px; bottom: 4px; width: 2px; background: #e5e7eb;
      }
      .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
      .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; }
      .btn-ghost { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; }
      .btn:hover { opacity: .9; }
      .file-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
      input[type=file] { font-size: 14px; padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #d1d5db; border-radius: 6px; width: 100%; background: #fafafa; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
      th, td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
      th { background: #fafafa; color: #6b7280; font-weight: 500; }
      .muted { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; }
      .note { background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; color: #92400e; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
      code { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
      .cols { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
      .cols span { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: #374151; }
      .req-star { color: #dc2626; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
      th, td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; vertical-align: top; }
      th { background: #fafafa; color: #6b7280; font-weight: 500; }
      .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
      .tag.green { background: #f0fdf4; color: #15803d; }
      .tag.gray { background: #f3f4f6; color: #9ca3af; }
      .btn-link { background: none; border: none; color: #2563eb; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; padding: 2px 6px; }
      .btn-link.danger { color: #dc2626; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("partials/nav", { active: "profile" }) %>

    <div class="wrap">
      <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-err"><%= error %></div><% } %>
      <% if (notice) { %><div class="alert alert-ok"><%= notice %></div><% } %>
      <% if (report && report.failed && report.failed.length > 0) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-err">
          没有任何一行通过校验，失败 <%= report.failed.length %> 行：
          <ul style="margin:8px 0 0 18px;">
            <% report.failed.forEach(function (f) { %>
              <li>第 <%= f.line %> 行 —— <%= f.reason %></li>
            <% }) %>
          </ul>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>批量导入客户档案</h2>

        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            下载模板，按表头填写（只填 <span class="req-star">*</span> 标记的三列即可）
            <div class="cols"><% templateHeaders.forEach(function(h){ %><span><%= h %></span><% }) %></div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;">
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/profiles/template.csv">⬇ 下载 CSV 模板</a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            保存为 <code>.csv</code> 文件（Excel 另存为时选「CSV UTF-8」）后上传
          </li>
          <li>
            系统逐行校验：<strong>手机号已存在则更新该记录，否则新增</strong>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0;margin:6px 0 18px;" />

        <form method="post" action="/profiles/import" enctype="multipart/form-data">
          <input type="file" name="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" required />
          <div class="file-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">开始导入</button>
            <a href="/profiles" class="btn btn-ghost">取消</a>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="note">
          <strong>导入规则</strong><br />
          • 必填列：公司名称、联系人、手机（表头名支持多种写法，如「公司名」「客户名称」「company」均可）<br />
          • 手机号是去重依据：库中已存在 → <strong>更新</strong>；不存在 → <strong>新增</strong><br />
          • 单次最多 <strong><%= maxRows %></strong> 行，文件不超过 <strong>2MB</strong><br />
          • 出错的行会被跳过，不影响其他行，并列出行号与原因<br />
          • 导入完成后提供「一键撤销」：删除本次新增、还原本次更新
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;">
        来源渠道可选值：<%= sources.join(" / ") %>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 导入历史：关掉页面也能随时撤销 -->
    <div class="card">
      <h2>导入历史</h2>
      <% if (!batches || batches.length === 0) { %>
        <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;padding:20px 0;">还没有导入记录</p>
      <% } else { %>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>批次</th><th>文件名</th><th>总行</th><th>新增</th><th>更新</th><th>失败</th>
              <th>导入时间</th><th>状态</th><th>操作</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% batches.forEach(function (b) { %>
              <tr>
                <td>#<%= b.id %></td>
                <td style="max-width:180px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;"><%= b.fileName %></td>
                <td><%= b.totalRows %></td>
                <td><%= b.insertedCount %></td>
                <td><%= b.updatedCount %></td>
                <td><%= b.failedCount %></td>
                <td class="muted"><%= b.createdAt.toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace("T", " ") %></td>
                <td>
                  <% if (b.status === "rolled_back") { %>
                    <span class="tag gray">已撤销</span>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <span class="tag green">已生效</span>
                  <% } %>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <% if (b.status === "committed") { %>
                    <form method="post" action="/profiles/import/<%= b.id %>/rollback"
                          onsubmit="return confirm('撤销批次 #<%= b.id %>？\n将删除该批次新增的记录，并还原被覆盖的记录。')">
                      <button type="submit" class="btn-link danger">撤销</button>
                    </form>
                  <% } else { %>
                    <span class="muted">—</span>
                  <% } %>
                </td>
              </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>